  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Hope</strong> to mark a target within Far range as your Bounty. Until this feature ends, against your Bounty you gain:</p><ul><li><p>You know precisely what direction they are in.</p></li><li><p>Add your level to your damage rolls against them.</p></li><li><p>When you deal damage to them, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to give them a temporary condition: <em>Distracted</em> or <em>Vulnerable</em>.</p></li><li><p>You cannot mark another target as your Bounty as long as the Bounty is defeated or until the scene ends.</p></li></ul>",
